<title>UK: Findomestic SPA sets 82 billion lire five-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Findomestic SPA sets 82 billion lire five-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager IMI Sigeco.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FINDOMESTIC SPA</p>
<p> AMT    82 BLN LIRE   BASE	 3M-RIBOR  MATURITY    09.DEC.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     40 BP     PAY DATE    09.DEC.96</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   UNDISC</p>
<p> LISTING    NONE	DENOMS (M) FIVE	GOV LAW     ITALIAN</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
